# Releasing a plugin that is not this one

## Repository settings this expects

- Every context the ABI floor workflow reports, required on those branches.

  The contexts the ABI floor workflow reports are
  `The plugin compiles against the floor its manifest promises`, which is the build
  against the floor, and `And it refuses a symbol the floor does not have`, which is
  the half that refuses a symbol the floor does not carry, and
  `A context this workflow does not report`, which no job here is about.

  Nothing else on this page is about a context.
